T(n,k) = Number of n X k 0..1 arrays with every element unequal to 0, 1, 3, 4 or 7 king-move adjacent elements, with upper left element zero.

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
